      "body": "Superseded by #2019, which archives this branch (and the other five holding unmerged work) as an indexed patch bundle under docs/archive/deepseek-branches-20261009/ with a full commit index. This PR became DIRTY against main after the other consolidation merges landed (#2012, #2015-#2018), and its content is preserved verbatim in the archive, so it is closed rather than rebased: nothing is lost, and the single serialized required-transport queue is not spent re-landing work that is already captured. Owner direction, 9 October 2026: retained work lands as indexed source patches on main; branches are temporary transport, not alternate authorities. References #820",
